**Workflow:**

```
Send Generic Email
    ↓
1. Validate SMTP configuration
    ├─ Server address not empty
    ├─ Username not empty
    ├─ Password not empty
    ├─ If missing → Log error & return false
    ↓
2. Configure SMTP client
    ├─ EnableSSL = true
    ├─ UseDefaultCredentials = false
    ├─ Timeout = 10 seconds
    ├─ SecurityProtocol = TLS 1.2
    ↓
3. Create MailMessage object
    ├─ From: Sender email
    ├─ To: Recipient email
    ├─ Subject: Email subject
    ├─ Body: HTML content
    ├─ IsBodyHtml = true
    ├─ CharacterEncoding = UTF-8
    ↓
4. Send via SMTP
    ├─ If success → Log & return true
    ├─ If SMTP error → Log error & return false
    ├─ If other error → Log error & return false
    ↓
5. Log result to file
```

**Email Templates:**

