| **Email Service** | Send notifications | Config → Validate → SMTP → Template → Send | TLS 1.2, error logging |
| **OTP Service** | Two-factor auth | Generate → Rate limit → Email → Verify | 5-minute expiry, 33sec cooldown |
| **Abuse Detection** | Anti-spam/bot | Track attempts → Calculate risk → Challenge/Block | Risk scoring, IP blocking |
| **VNPay Payment** | Payment processing | Build URL → HMAC hash → Redirect → Verify response | HMAC-SHA512, hash verification |
| **Lucky Spin** | Gamification | Spin wheel → Calculate winner → Award prize | WinRate probability |
| **Audit Logging** | Compliance tracking | Record admin actions → Store → Log | Immutable audit trail |
| **Caching** | Performance optimization | Query cache → On miss fetch DB → Store | Pattern-based invalidation |

